              "value": {
                "string": "The authors thank Stefan L. Ameres for help with the experimental design. The authors acknowledge the Genomics technology platform of the Max Delbrück Center for Molecular Medicine for high-throughput sequencing. Computation has been performed on the HPC for the Research cluster of the Berlin Institute of Health. Figure 1A was created with BioRender. We thank members of the Blüthgen and Landthaler labs for fruitful discussions. Funding was provided by Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (grants RTG2424 CompCancer and SFB/ TRR 186 to DS)."
